# Vercel only runs the functions in api/; the site itself is on GitHub Pages.
# Upload nothing else, so the public pages never share the admin's origin and
# nothing local (private/, .env*, test logs) can ship. The CLI doesn't read
# .gitignore when this file exists.
/*
!/api
!/talk
/talk/*
!/talk/targets.json
!/vercel.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
